# Deny by default: a source build must never send local state or credentials.
**
!build.sh
!requirements.txt
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
# Dockerfile copies these compile trees before its native/WASM build layers.
# Keep host sources and C++ tests: core CMake declares cross-tree targets too.
!core/
!core/**
!host/
!host/CMakeLists.txt
!host/src/
!host/src/**
!host/cmake/
!host/cmake/**
!host/extern/
!host/extern/mapbox/
!host/extern/mapbox/**
!host/tests/
!host/tests/**
!host/wasm/
!host/wasm/**
!services/
!services/**
!contracts/
!contracts/**
# WASM links these assets and build.sh checks the staged bundle against them.
!assets/
!assets/fonts/
!assets/fonts/**
!assets/icons/
!assets/icons/atlas.json
!assets/icons/atlas_dark.png
!assets/icons/atlas_light.png
!assets/ui-shared-manifest.json
!assets/logo_icon.png
!assets/logo_wordmark.png
!assets/logo_wordmark_dark.png
!extern/
!extern/glad/
!extern/glad/**
!scripts/
!scripts/check_web_parity.py
# Runtime-only helpers are copied after compilation, not into its cache key.
!web/
!web/gateway/
!web/gateway/**
!web/deploy/
!web/deploy/Caddyfile
!web/deploy/cell/
!web/deploy/cell/**
!web/deploy/container/
!web/deploy/container/**

# Re-exclude generated output and local/private material in allowed source trees.
**/.*
**/.*/**
**/build
**/build-*
**/build/**
**/build-*/**
# Managed dependencies must be fetched in-image with their Git identities intact;
# copying a host cache without .git makes the pinned-source checks reject it.
**/third_party
**/third_party/**
**/dist
**/dist/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*_test.py
**/conftest.py
# CMake declares native test targets even when only application targets build;
# their C++ sources must remain available during configure.
**/test_*.py
**/AGENTS.md
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*~
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/config.json
**/imgui.ini
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/venv
**/venv/**
**/*.step+
**/*.aicm
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
